## Session Pilot Lite (always on)

At the start of every chat: `python ~/.cursor/skills/session-pilot-lite/scripts/splite.py recall`.
On task prompt: `python ~/.cursor/skills/session-pilot-lite/scripts/splite.py find "<3-6 keywords>"`. Read top SKILL.md.
After progress: `python ~/.cursor/skills/session-pilot-lite/scripts/splite.py save --done "<action>" --next "<step>"`.
<!-- session-pilot-lite:end -->
